VERDICT: GATE PASSED. Genuine incomplete fix -- distinct CVEs, distinct fixed versions
(4.2.4 vs 5.3.5), same unescaped-entity-name -> RegExp sink; the 4.2.4 blocklist widening
(adds '|','+') closes the original but MISSES '.', leaving the CVE-2026-25896 residual open on
V1, which 5.3.5 closes by escaping regex metacharacters. Confirmed end-to-end through a REAL
Express service running REAL fast-xml-parser, triggered by EXTERNAL HTTP POST.
